==Dialogue==
{{Stub Dialogue}}
===Discuss your next trip with the others{{subst:void|<!--103600101-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=trailblaze|location=Party Car|It has been a while since you awoke from the dream. Staring into the deep sky, you think back on everything you've gained from your adventure so far and begin to grow excited for your next trailblazing expedition. Outside your window, the mysterious air of your destination piques your... Hold on? Why are we still on Penacony?<br />Looks like it's time to discuss your upcoming trip with the rest of the crew.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}

;(Talk to Welt Yang)
:'''Welt:''' Amphoreus, The Eternal Land...
:'''Dan Heng:''' There is no record of this world in the data bank... Not even a mention of its name.
:'''March 7th:''' Yeah, that's what Miss Black Swan said. It's a world hidden away from outside observation, with a presence only revealed by the light from the mirror of the Garden of Recollection. It's mysterious, alright.
:'''March 7th:''' You haven't been with us on the Express very long, (Trailblazer). Will the journey be too much for you to handle?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Nah, it's no sweat.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Sounds scary. Can we go somewhere else?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I've been on the Express for nearly two years now...
::'''March 7th:''' Huh? Has it been that long?
:'''Himeko:''' There's no need to be nervous. I understand that it may be difficult for us today to wrap our heads around the idea that there's a world Akivili didn't venture into, but a journey like that was only routine to the Express Crew back then. After all, to trailblaze is to explore the universe's boundaries.
:'''Welt:''' We should consider Pom-Pom's opinion, too. They don't know we're considering Amphoreus as a destination.
:'''Himeko:''' Sure, I'll take care of it. That said, Pom-Pom usually stays out of discussions about destinations. The final decision will likely still be on us to make.
:'''Dan Heng:''' In that case, we'd best take the time to think this over.
:'''March 7th:''' Yeah! Plus, even if we pass Amphoreus over, we've still got a fuel problem to solve.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} That's what I thought, too.
::'''Himeko:''' Alright, then. For now, I'll let Miss Black Swan know that we're considering The Eternal Land as a destination.
::Can I vote no?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Can I vote no?
:'''Himeko:''' Of course you can. For now, I'll let Miss Black Swan know that we're considering The Eternal Land as a possible destination, but we're also keeping our options open.
:'''Himeko:''' Seeing as how this is going to be an unusual adventure, it'd be good for us to take some time out to make preparations for the journey. Meanwhile, I'll see if I can find out more about Amphoreus from our allies before we depart.
:{{tx}}

{{Dialogue End}}

